# Legacy a2c corpus: 02_types/004_pointer

## Case: legacy-02-types-004-pointer
id: "legacy.02_types.004_pointer"
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "pointer.at"
```auto
fn inc(a *int) {
    a.* += 1
}

fn main() {
    var x = 5;
    print("x = ", x)
    var y *int = x.@
    print("y = ", y.*)
    y.* += 1
    print("now x is", x)

    inc(x.@)
    print("now x is", x)
}
```

### Rust
check-id: "a2c-emit"

#### pointer.expected.c
```c
#include "pointer.h"

void inc(int* a) {
    *a += 1;
}

int main(void) {
    int x = 5;
    printf("%s %d\n", "x = ", x);
    int* y = &x;
    printf("%s %d\n", "y = ", *y);
    *y += 1;
    printf("%s %d\n", "now x is", x);

    inc(&x);
    printf("%s %d\n", "now x is", x);
    return 0;
}
```

